ALBUKHR Pi dApp Launch Service
Mataki na 1: API Audit, Tsarin API Contract da Database Migration Plan
Sigar: 1.0
Rana: 11 Oktoba 2026
Yanayi: Tsarin zane ne kawai — ba a canza source code, Supabase, storage, ko production ba.
Repo da aka duba: MuhmdBuharisaeed/albukhr-api (default branch main), tare da sakamakon binciken user-side da Supabase na Phase 0.
1. Takaitaccen sakamako
API na ALBUKHR ya riga yana da wasu kayan aikin Pi Platform API, amma babu dedicated dApp Launch Service gateway a cikin repo da aka duba. Hanyoyin Pi payment da suke akwai sun dace da Core Project investment/liquidity; ba su dace a sake amfani da su kai tsaye don biyan kuɗin dApp service ba.
Shawarar gine-gine ita ce a ƙara sabon module mai zaman kansa, misali src/dapp-service-gateway.js, tare da routes ƙarƙashin /api/dapp-service/. Wannan ƙari ne mai iyaka wanda ba zai buƙaci sauya src/financial-gateway.js, src/pi-client.js, src/supabase-client.js, auth core, ko Dock Navigation ba. A lokacin coding za a sake tabbatar da wannan iyakar kafin a taɓa kowane fayil.
Bank transfer da Pi payment su kasance hanyoyi biyu masu zaman kansu na tabbatar da biyan kuɗi. Receipt ba tabbacin bank transfer ba ne; haka ma amsar frontend ko txid da aka turo daga browser kaɗai ba tabbacin Pi payment ba ne.
