3. Dokokin tsarin da za a kiyaye
Pi UID ya fito daga Pi Platform API: API ta tabbatar da access token ta GET /v2/me; kada ta dogara da pi_uid, username, ko user ID da browser ya turo.
Mainnet API ya kulle network: network = 'mainnet' daga server config; kada a karɓi network a matsayin ikonsar browser. Gwajin Testnet, idan an buƙata daga baya, ya kasance a rabe da Mainnet credentials da Supabase.
Ba a karɓar adadin kuɗi daga client a matsayin tushen gaskiya: API ta samo adadin daga quote/price record da aka amince da shi.
Payment status da request status daban: an biya ba yana nufin an amince da project ba; an amince da project ba yana nufin an biya ba; an biya kuma ba yana nufin an kammala aikin dApp ba.
Pi approval/completion server-side ne: API ta yi magana da Pi Platform da PI_API_KEY daga secrets na server kawai. Kada a saka key a frontend ko repo.
Idempotency: Pi SDK na iya maimaita callbacks; approvals/completions da bank reconciliation dole ne su jure maimaitawa ba tare da biyan abu ko buɗe service sau biyu ba.
Babu localStorage a matsayin tushen bayanan dApp service: requests, quotes, payment intents da status su zauna a Supabase. Shared auth core ya ci gaba da zama tushen identity; kada a ƙirƙiri parallel login ko a canza Page Auth Guard.
Admin security: admin payment confirmation da request workflow su yi amfani da tsarin Admin Auth/MFA/AAL2 da role checks da ALBUKHR ke da su; kada a ƙirƙiri sabuwar hanyar admin login.
