4.2 Tsarin Pi payment handshake
Mai amfani ya zaɓi request/quote kuma API ta ƙirƙiri payment intent mai adadin Pi da aka amince da shi.
Frontend ya kira Pi SDK createPayment da amount, memo da metadata daga intent. Waɗannan bayanan daga browser ba su zama hujjar biyan kuɗi ba.
Callback onReadyForServerApproval(paymentId) ya aika paymentId da intent identifier zuwa ALBUKHR API.
API ta tabbatar da Pi access token ta GET /v2/me, ta tabbatar cewa intent ɗin na UID ɗin ne, ta ɗauko PaymentDTO daga Pi Platform API, ta kwatanta adadi/metadata/memo da DB, sannan ta kira POST /v2/payments/{paymentId}/approve.
Callback onReadyForServerCompletion(paymentId, txid) ya aika ainihin values zuwa API.
API ta sake ɗauko payment, ta tabbatar da intent da owner da expected amount, ta kira POST /v2/payments/{paymentId}/complete tare da txid, sannan ta tabbatar da amsar Pi da final status/transaction ID kafin ta rubuta payment_status = confirmed.
Dole ne unique constraint/idempotency guard ya hana repeated callbacks ƙirƙirar payment biyu ko tura service sau biyu.
A auth startup/recovery, a duba incomplete payments bisa tsarin Pi SDK. A haɗa wannan da AlbukhrPiAuth; kada a ƙirƙiri sabon auth core ko a mayar da token zuwa localStorage.
Muhimmin audit note: src/pi-client.js na yanzu yana da verifyPaymentMetadata() mai buƙatar metadata.action === 'add_liquidity'. Kada a cire wannan takurawar ko a faɗaɗa ta gaba ɗaya domin dApp service; a yi validator na dApp-service daban ko a tsara abstraction mai tests da baya canza legacy contract.
4.3 Tsarin bank transfer
API ta ƙirƙiri bank-transfer intent daga quote da aka amince da shi, ta nuna asusun karɓa da reference na musamman idan an saita su.
Mai amfani ya tura kuɗi ta banki, sannan ya gabatar da bank transfer reference, ranar/sa'a, sunan mai aika kuɗi idan akwai, adadin da ya ce ya tura, da receipt a private storage.
Matsayi ya zama submitted_for_review ko makamancin haka; receipt ba ya mayar da payment confirmed.
Admin mai izini kuma ya tabbatar da MFA/AAL2 ya kwatanta bayanan da bank statement ko bank portal. Sai an samu daidaito ne zai iya rubuta confirmed, tare da actor, timestamp, bank reference da audit event.
Idan bayanan ba su dace ba, a yi rejected ko manual_review; kada a share tarihin evidence/events.
Babu bank API integration da aka tabbatar a wannan audit. Don haka a fara da manual verification, sai a haɗa bank/provider API daga baya idan an zaɓi shi a hukumance.
5. Database migration plan — zane kawai
Ba a ƙirƙiri ko gudanar da SQL ba. A lokacin aiwatarwa, za a fara da schema review na ƙarshe, migration a Testnet ko local/staging, sannan a yi security review kafin Mainnet.
5.1 Tables da ake buƙata
dapp_service_catalog
id, service_code, display_name, description, is_active, supported_payment_methods, created_at, updated_at.
Wannan ya raba nau'in sabis da farashinsa. Kada frontend ya zama tushen farashi ko eligibility.
dapp_service_requests
id UUID, network, pi_uid, pi_username, project_name, service_code, description, request_status, consent_version, consented_at, created_at, updated_at.
pi_uid a rubuta shi daga verified /v2/me, ba daga request body ba.
request_status ya bayyana aikin request: submitted, under_review, needs_information, approved, rejected, in_progress, delivered, cancelled.
dapp_service_quotes
id UUID, request_id, network, payment_method, currency (NGN ko PI), amount NUMERIC, pricing_version, description/scope, status (issued, accepted, expired, withdrawn), issued_by, issued_at, expires_at, accepted_at.
Quote na bank transfer da quote na Pi su kasance distinct saboda currencies ba su daidai ba. Kada a canza NGN zuwa Pi da market rate marar amincewa.
dapp_service_payment_intents
id UUID, request_id, quote_id, network, method (bank_transfer ko pi), currency, expected_amount NUMERIC, status, pi_payment_id, pi_txid, bank_reference, created_at, updated_at, confirmed_at, verified_by.
Unique partial indexes kan pi_payment_id da pi_txid idan ba NULL ba, da checks da ke hana intent ɗaya samun conflicting settlement. A yi idempotency ta DB transaction/RPC, ba in-memory Set kaɗai ba.
dapp_service_payment_evidence
id UUID, payment_intent_id, network, storage_bucket, storage_path, original_filename, mime_type, size_bytes, bank_reference, sender_name, claimed_amount, transfer_at, status, submitted_at, reviewed_by, reviewed_at, review_note.
Receipt ya kasance private; kada a adana signed URL mai tsawo. Admin ya sami short-lived signed URL bayan izini.
dapp_service_payment_events
id UUID, payment_intent_id, network, event_type, actor_type, actor_id, idempotency_key, safe_metadata JSONB, created_at.
Append-only audit trail. Kada a rubuta access token, server API key, wallet seed, ko cikakken secret a safe_metadata.
5.2 RLS da izini
A kunna RLS a duk tables; browser ba zai sami direct write permission ga payments, quotes, evidence verification ko request status ba.
API ta amfani da server-only Supabase client ga user routes, bayan ta tabbatar da Pi identity da ownership.
Admin actions su bi tsarin admin login/MFA/AAL2 da server-side role check. A yi amfani da albukhr_security RPCs/authorization pattern inda ya dace; kada a yarda da admin_role ko verified=true daga browser.
Storage bucket mai zaman kansa, misali dapp-service-payment-evidence, tare da signed upload/view permission mai iyaka. A tantance allowed MIME types, file extension, size limit, path ownership da retention policy kafin coding.
A saka network a duk records masu dangantaka. Mainnet gateway ya kafa mainnet daga server; client-supplied network ba shi da iko.
5.3 State separation da invariants
A ajiye request workflow da payment workflow daban.
Request workflow: submitted → under_review → approved/needs_information/rejected → in_progress → delivered
Bank evidence workflow: not_submitted → submitted_for_review → confirmed/rejected/manual_review
Pi payment workflow: created → awaiting_approval → awaiting_user_action → awaiting_completion → confirmed, tare da terminal/exception states cancelled, failed, expired, manual_review.
Jerin final status zai zama na implementation bayan an zaɓi refunds/cancellation policy. Kada frontend ya iya sa paid, confirmed, delivered ko approved kai tsaye.
6. Farashi: abin da har yanzu bai yanke ba
A UI da aka duba, an nuna farashin ₦35,000 na Pi Studio Assistance da ₦500,000 na Developer-built dApp, amma akwai rubutu da ke cewa service fee yana da sassauci. Wannan sabani ne da dole a warware kafin coding.
Shawarar farko: a yi quote-first model: Admin ya bayyana scope da farashi, user ya amince da quote, sannan ya zaɓi bank transfer (NGN quote) ko Pi (Pi-denominated quote). A nuna farashin Pi dabam a matsayin adadin da aka amince da shi; kada a lissafa shi ta atomatik daga NGN ta farashin kasuwar Pi ba tare da ƙa'ida da aka amince da ita ba.
Kafin a fara coding, sai a tabbatar da:
Ko ₦35,000/₦500,000 su ne fixed prices, starting prices, ko misalai kawai.
Wane adadin Pi za a karɓa ga kowane service, ko sai Admin ya ba da Pi quote na musamman.
Refund/cancellation rules da lokacin ƙarewar quote.
Official bank account/reference da yadda Admin zai daidaita bank statement.
Abin da ake ɗauka a matsayin delivered/complete service da support/revision limits.
Ba a ƙirƙiri lambar asusun banki, farashin Pi, exchange rate ko refund policy a wannan audit ba.
7. Fayilolin da ake sa ran a taɓa a lokacin implementation
Waɗannan shawarwari ne kawai; ba a taɓa su ba:
API: ƙara src/dapp-service-gateway.js da register a server.js; ƙara helper daban idan ya zama dole. Kada a canza legacy investment validation.
Frontend: gyara pi-dapp-service.html, my-dapp-requests.html da dedicated JS files su yi amfani da dApp service API da AlbukhrPiAuth/existing cores. A cire legacy references ga fayilolin da ba su cikin main bayan an tabbatar a live deployment.
Admin: ƙara dedicated dApp service queue/quote/payment verification UI ta amfani da existing Admin Auth/MFA/AAL2. Kada a haɗa shi cikin External Projects workflow ba tare da bukata ba.
Supabase: migration mai versioned SQL, RLS, role-checked RPCs, indexes, event logging da private bucket rules.
Docs: terms, privacy/retention, fee/quote policy, refund/cancellation policy da service scope.
8. Acceptance tests kafin release
Mai amfani A ba zai iya karanta request ko intent na mai amfani B ba.
Ƙirƙirar request ko intent da fake pi_uid/network ba zai yi nasara ba.
Client cannot override quote amount, currency, service code, recipient, or payment method after quote acceptance.
Pi approval ya ƙi payment ID da bai dace da intent/UID/amount/metadata ba.
Pi completion ya ƙi missing/fake txid, mismatch, non-completed response ko Pi API failure.
Repeated Pi callbacks sun dawo da sakamako mai aminci ba tare da duplicate settlement ba.
Incomplete payment recovery yana ɗauko payment daga Pi API, ba ya yarda da payload na browser a matsayin shaida.
Bank receipt upload ba ya sa payment ya zama confirmed; admin reconciliation kaɗai ke yi.
Admin action ba ya aiki ba tare da role check da MFA/AAL2 ba.
Receipt path ba ya zama public URL; signed URL yana da expiration kuma yana buƙatar authorized workflow.
Request approval, payment confirmation da service delivery suna da separate transitions da audit events.
Route /api/dapp-service/* ba ya sauya sakamakon legacy /api/pi-payment-approve da /api/pi-payment-complete.
Mainnet deployment yana amfani da Mainnet Supabase, Mainnet Pi API credentials da correct Pi SDK mode; babu cross-network reads/writes.
Negative tests da log review ba su fallasa Pi access token, PI_API_KEY, Supabase service-role key, ko wallet seed.
