10. Hukuncin wannan mataki
Binciken API da Pi payment documentation ya kammala. Mataki na gaba na implementation bai fara ba. Abin da ya rage kafin coding shi ne a amince da quote/pricing policy, bank details da refund/cancellation/service-delivery rules. Bayan haka za a iya shirya migration SQL da gateway patch a branch, a gudanar da tests a staging, sannan a gabatar da diff kafin kowane Mainnet deployment.
